    "KenLM reserves <unk> and allocates probability to it; local <UNK> has zero mass with epsilon=0.",
    "KenLM unigram ARPA includes reserved <s> and <unk>; local event unigrams omit both.",
    "KenLM --interpolate_unigrams 0 assigns lower-order residual mass to <unk>; the local unigram uses continuation frequency without residual interpolation.",
