    "Historical ExtensionLM defaults epsilon=1e-8; this comparison uses epsilon=0 and reports the known-token delta separately.",
    "KenLM suppresses repeated-BOS higher-order grams; local events uses n-1 BOS prefixes, affecting trigram count-of-counts and lower-order discounts.",
